  speakerName: Tomas
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Welcome to the clay yard!

    If you want someone to stop at the
    place where they are standing, you can say ''agsardeng ditoy.''

    It means
    ''stop here.''

    Listen carefully: agsardeng ditoy.

    Now, try saying ''agsardeng
    ditoy'' yourself.'
